@startuml
title Use Case 1.3: Animal Detail View

actor User
participant AnimalDetail.vue
participant animals.ts
participant animals.py
participant animal_service.py
database MySQL

User -> AnimalDetail.vue: Click animal card
AnimalDetail.vue -> animals.ts: getAnimal(id)
animals.ts -> animals.py: GET /animals/{id}
animals.py -> animal_service.py: get_animal(id)
animal_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT animal with images
MySQL --> animal_service.py: animal data
animal_service.py --> animals.py: animal dict
animals.py --> animals.ts: 200 OK
animals.ts --> AnimalDetail.vue: animal
AnimalDetail.vue --> User: Display details

@enduml
